WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.186
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:24.456 --> 00:25.816
Honey!

3
00:25.816 --> 00:27.275
Everyone, take a good look at this!

4
00:27.275 --> 00:29.669
This woman stole my husband!

5
00:30.001 --> 00:31.558
Investigate that girl's background.

6
00:32.034 --> 00:34.034
If she's chosen to destroy my reputation...

7
00:34.232 --> 00:35.445
She will pay for it

8
00:36.204 --> 00:39.630
Isn't she the pregnant woman who ruined your wedding?

9
00:39.631 --> 00:40.992
Hey! Wait, what?

10
00:41.427 --> 00:42.345
We've got her.

11
00:55.466 --> 00:56.614
And I suppose your twin...

12
00:57.322 --> 01:00.000
Also passed her baby-powder scent on to you, huh?

13
01:02.812 --> 01:03.700
Ow!

14
01:04.961 --> 01:08.073
We stay together.

15
01:08.073 --> 01:08.809
So...

16
01:09.301 --> 01:11.301
We have the same smell.

17
01:15.966 --> 01:17.233
Then video-call her.

18
01:18.633 --> 01:20.100
Call your twin right now.

19
01:21.400 --> 01:22.466
If she answers,

20
01:23.033 --> 01:24.100
I'll let you go.

21
01:29.466 --> 01:30.266
Call her!

22
01:33.433 --> 01:35.466
Ow!

23
01:35.466 --> 01:38.000
I think that won't happen.

24
01:38.000 --> 01:38.800
My sister

25
01:38.866 --> 01:40.100
is probably asleep,

26
01:40.266 --> 01:41.033
you know,

27
01:41.033 --> 01:41.966
because you forgot...

28
01:42.100 --> 01:42.900
You forgot...

29
01:42.966 --> 01:43.766
She just had...

30
01:43.866 --> 01:44.666
a baby,

31
01:44.700 --> 01:45.500
you know?

32
01:45.854 --> 01:47.854
She might be sleeping.

33
01:48.500 --> 01:49.566
Stop making excuses.

34
01:52.614 --> 01:54.614
What happened?

35
01:56.489 --> 01:58.489
You gave birth, and your belly shrank right away?

36
02:01.680 --> 02:02.719
Bravo!

37
02:03.324 --> 02:04.869
What a medical miracle.

38
02:05.586 --> 02:06.878
Ow!

39
02:07.586 --> 02:10.395
Because the doctor is fantastic.

40
02:11.266 --> 02:13.233
Save your excuses for the police.

41
02:14.033 --> 02:15.900
Jaokha, call the police.

42
02:16.866 --> 02:17.666
Hey!

43
02:17.833 --> 02:19.566
It was just a wedding disruption.

44
02:19.766 --> 02:21.200
You have to call the police over that?

45
02:21.800 --> 02:22.600
Hmph.

46
02:23.566 --> 02:24.600
You just admitted it.

47
02:24.900 --> 02:26.666
You were just hired to ruin my wedding, huh?

48
02:27.066 --> 02:28.566
My company's stock price dropped.

49
02:29.200 --> 02:30.366
Investors pulled out.

50
02:30.800 --> 02:32.766
The damages are incalculable.

51
02:32.900 --> 02:34.833
And you still think it's no big deal?

52
02:35.700 --> 02:36.666
Did you get through yet?

53
02:38.066 --> 02:38.866
I'm still trying.

54
02:39.066 --> 02:40.500
It keeps telling me to press 1 and 2.

55
02:40.666 --> 02:41.566
It keep going in circles.

56
02:41.800 --> 02:42.875
Then keep pressing them.

57
02:42.875 --> 02:43.375
Ow!

58
02:43.566 --> 02:44.866
The damn thing's bugged!

59
02:45.466 --> 02:46.266
Hey!

60
02:46.300 --> 02:47.433
Are you okay?

61
03:00.503 --> 03:01.303
No.

62
03:02.054 --> 03:02.854
No, I can't.

63
03:04.100 --> 03:05.233
I can't just leave.

64
03:06.466 --> 03:07.766
If I go back now,

65
03:08.966 --> 03:11.000
I won't get paid.

66
03:13.000 --> 03:13.833
What should I do?

67
03:16.666 --> 03:18.046
Tell the manager

68
03:18.299 --> 03:19.906
to lock every exit.

69
03:20.412 --> 03:20.968
Right now!

70
03:21.474 --> 03:22.422
Okay.

71
03:37.366 --> 03:38.200
Did you find her?

72
03:38.666 --> 03:40.766
She's disappeared! What are we gonna do now?

73
03:42.266 --> 03:43.002
It's fine.

74
03:44.418 --> 03:46.514
We'll check the security cameras and see where she's hiding.

75
04:01.400 --> 04:02.160
Jaokha.

76
04:03.424 --> 04:04.766
Can I borrow your lipstick?

77
04:05.800 --> 04:06.740
What for?

78
04:06.740 --> 04:07.300
Well...

79
04:09.033 --> 04:11.023
To make a murder scene

80
04:11.984 --> 04:14.100
and show that girl who she's messing with.

81
04:16.466 --> 04:17.266
Here.

82
04:32.700 --> 04:34.560
You guys go find the manager.

83
04:34.560 --> 04:37.500
I'll look around here.

84
04:39.466 --> 04:41.766
Sure. Let's go, Jaokha.

85
04:50.076 --> 04:51.470
Let’s see

86
04:53.182 --> 04:56.723
Who can outlast the other in this game?

87
06:14.300 --> 06:15.100
Ow!

88
06:15.766 --> 06:17.400
She probably gave up and went home.

89
06:19.466 --> 06:20.266
Right?

90
06:23.866 --> 06:24.666
Come on.

91
06:25.833 --> 06:27.266
Let's get back to work.

92
06:31.466 --> 06:32.266
My damn life...

93
06:38.266 --> 06:39.200
Playing hide-and-seek...

94
06:40.100 --> 06:40.900
Having fun?

95
06:45.366 --> 06:46.166
You...

96
06:49.600 --> 06:50.400
Hey!

97
06:51.000 --> 06:51.800
Blood!

98
06:52.033 --> 06:53.033
This is your doing.

99
06:54.666 --> 06:56.033
You're a scammer,

100
06:56.600 --> 06:57.466
a thief,

101
06:58.100 --> 06:59.300
and a thug, too.

102
07:00.233 --> 07:01.700
You've got quite a rap sheet.

103
07:02.766 --> 07:04.766
I'm none of those things you just called me.

104
07:08.466 --> 07:09.266
How about this?

105
07:10.700 --> 07:12.066
I'll pay you back.

106
07:13.400 --> 07:14.966
The money you stole?

107
07:16.000 --> 07:18.366
That wouldn't even cover my medical bills.

108
07:27.166 --> 07:27.966
What are you doing?

109
07:37.500 --> 07:38.300
You...

110
07:47.633 --> 07:48.133
I...

111
07:49.549 --> 07:51.450
I told you I didn't steal anything.

112
07:52.259 --> 07:52.804
That was...

113
07:53.158 --> 07:55.420
money the customers gave me as tips!

114
07:57.500 --> 07:58.400
Tips?

115
08:05.700 --> 08:07.766
I'm not interested in the money anymore.

116
08:09.166 --> 08:10.500
But I want to know...

117
08:12.300 --> 08:14.900
Have you hidden anything else from customers in your clothes?

118
08:20.666 --> 08:22.000
Please let me go.

119
08:26.800 --> 08:27.600
Take it off.

120
08:29.500 --> 08:30.300
Huh?

121
08:31.033 --> 08:33.800
Take it off? Here?

122
08:36.300 --> 08:38.467
Or should I call the police to search you

123
08:39.731 --> 08:40.966
right here?

124
08:42.382 --> 08:43.066
Your choice.

125
08:49.066 --> 08:50.500
Please let me go.

126
08:54.233 --> 08:55.033
What are you doing?

127
08:58.100 --> 08:59.633
You're so flat.

128
09:02.400 --> 09:05.966
So where did your baby come out, then?

129
09:08.066 --> 09:09.433
Tiger's mom.

130
09:13.700 --> 09:15.166
Please let me go.

131
09:18.300 --> 09:19.100
Scared?

132
09:22.100 --> 09:22.662
Good.

133
09:23.673 --> 09:25.065
Remember this feeling.

134
09:26.633 --> 09:28.054
Because from now on,

135
09:28.914 --> 09:31.969
you'll pay me back until I'm satisfied.

136
09:40.166 --> 09:41.066
What are you doing?

137
09:42.066 --> 09:42.966
What are you doing?!

138
09:45.600 --> 09:46.866
You recover pretty quickly.

139
09:48.033 --> 09:50.466
Your water broke in the morning, and you're drinking at night.

140
09:55.200 --> 09:57.000
My doctor is just that good.

141
10:01.500 --> 10:02.458
A good doctor...

142
10:04.025 --> 10:05.084
Or was the pregnancy fake?

143
10:06.550 --> 10:09.351
I didn't expect you to show up and get caught this soon.

144
10:10.918 --> 10:12.521
Who hired you?

145
10:15.233 --> 10:16.433
Nobody hired me.

146
10:18.366 --> 10:18.895
Really?

147
10:20.108 --> 10:22.994
But less than an hour after you showed up at my wedding,

148
10:23.853 --> 10:26.418
embarrassing videos of me were all over social media.

149
10:29.233 --> 10:30.900
What does that have to do with me?

150
10:32.400 --> 10:33.200
It has everything to do with you.

151
10:33.866 --> 10:34.866
Those videos...

152
10:35.633 --> 10:37.066
Your people filmed them, didn't they?

153
10:37.766 --> 10:38.566
Huh?

154
10:39.366 --> 10:40.500
When you was crying,

155
10:41.566 --> 10:42.833
when your water broke,

156
10:43.366 --> 10:44.433
and when I fell.

157
10:45.366 --> 10:47.033
It was as if someone was waiting to capture every moment.

158
10:48.866 --> 10:49.670
You...

159
10:50.226 --> 10:51.956
You think I staged all of this?

160
10:53.271 --> 10:56.368
Or are you going to say it was a coincidence?

161
11:01.166 --> 11:04.063
Listen to me.

162
11:06.035 --> 11:07.316
I'll admit it.

163
11:11.066 --> 11:15.000
If I were really as good at planning things as you say I am,

164
11:16.466 --> 11:18.766
I wouldn't have to come back here and wait tables.

165
11:20.766 --> 11:21.353
Right?

166
11:23.830 --> 11:26.330
I'm telling you the truth.

167
11:28.049 --> 11:31.115
Someone really did hire me to ruin your wedding.

168
11:33.846 --> 11:36.121
But those videos and all that stuff...

169
11:36.576 --> 11:38.456
I swear I know nothing about them.

170
11:39.766 --> 11:41.033
So you've admitted it.

171
11:43.066 --> 11:45.166
You were hired to ruin my wedding.

172
11:48.366 --> 11:49.156
In that case,

173
11:49.763 --> 11:51.943
you'll pay for all the damages from today.

174
11:52.904 --> 11:54.553
You will pay me back

175
11:55.109 --> 11:57.604
every single cent. Do you understand?

176
12:09.666 --> 12:10.902
You found her, huh?

177
12:10.902 --> 12:11.800
Yeah

178
12:12.566 --> 12:15.500
Took her long enough to come out. I got eaten alive by mosquitoes.

179
12:17.400 --> 12:18.366
What happened?

180
12:19.766 --> 12:21.666
What happened to your face, Mrs. Chat?

181
12:22.566 --> 12:24.600
Nant, why do you look like that?

182
12:28.200 --> 12:29.433
Excuse me, Manager.

183
12:30.766 --> 12:32.400
What's the golden rule here?

184
12:33.700 --> 12:36.566
At Rush Bar, the customer is king.

185
12:39.166 --> 12:41.433
The last employee got fired just for stepping on a customer's foot.

186
12:42.766 --> 12:44.433
But I'm covered in blood.

187
12:49.600 --> 12:53.502
Wait, I barely headbutted her, though.

188
12:53.502 --> 12:56.200
Look at my forehead. There's not even a mark.

189
12:56.500 --> 12:57.966
Not everyone has a hard head like you.

190
13:00.266 --> 13:01.962
Excuse me, Manager.

191
13:03.125 --> 13:04.513
If a staff member

192
13:05.019 --> 13:07.433
attacks a customer and makes their head bleed like this,

193
13:09.600 --> 13:10.866
is that against the rules?

194
13:11.400 --> 13:12.200
Yes.

195
13:14.233 --> 13:15.700
And what happens

196
13:17.700 --> 13:18.833
if they break the rules?

197
13:19.466 --> 13:20.266
They're fired.

198
13:25.166 --> 13:27.900
If she's fired, do we still need the police?

199
13:28.266 --> 13:29.200
No, we don't.

200
13:30.600 --> 13:31.400
Oh.

201
13:31.600 --> 13:33.766
And blacklist this woman, too.

202
13:34.433 --> 13:36.266
I never want to see her here again.

203
13:42.400 --> 13:45.062
Ai, Jaokha, let's go.

204
13:45.719 --> 13:46.666
I'm not having fun anymore.

205
13:47.100 --> 13:47.900
Come on.

206
13:55.747 --> 13:56.635
But...

207
13:57.833 --> 14:00.296
I didn't do anything, sis. I only barely headbutted her.

208
14:00.296 --> 14:02.100
If you didn't do anything, why is her head bleeding?

209
14:02.700 --> 14:04.800
You're lucky she didn't have the police arrest you.

210
14:14.800 --> 14:16.900
Do rich people think they own the damn world?

211
14:17.500 --> 14:19.400
Everyone just does whatever they tell them to!

212
14:33.366 --> 14:34.166
Hey!

213
14:34.866 --> 14:35.700
Don't tell me...

214
14:36.300 --> 14:37.366
It's out of gas?

215
14:52.000 --> 14:54.000
Why is this world so mean to me?

216
14:59.833 --> 15:00.681
You always blame everything else

217
15:01.187 --> 15:03.433
whenever you have a problem,

218
15:04.040 --> 15:04.983
never yourself, don't you?

219
15:05.994 --> 15:07.381
Why don't you think about

220
15:07.935 --> 15:09.618
what you've done all this time

221
15:10.174 --> 15:11.643
to end up living like this?

222
15:14.424 --> 15:16.553
And is your motorbike broken down?

223
15:21.866 --> 15:23.839
Here. I'll help with the repair costs.

224
15:38.266 --> 15:39.066
Wow.

225
15:39.766 --> 15:41.400
Do you want money that badly?

226
15:41.966 --> 15:43.866
Mrs. Thitinant Inganant ******

227
15:45.266 --> 15:47.866
In life, we have plenty of choices.

228
15:49.166 --> 15:51.766
But you chose a path that makes you worthless.

229
15:54.866 --> 15:55.700
Worthless?

230
15:57.033 --> 15:58.066
Yes, I'm poor.

231
15:58.700 --> 16:00.833
But I've never judged someone's worth by their money.

232
16:01.900 --> 16:03.200
You're the one

233
16:04.433 --> 16:06.666
who thinks money lets you do whatever you want to anyone.

234
16:13.266 --> 16:14.178
Why?

235
16:14.684 --> 16:16.539
And what can someone like you do about it?

236
16:26.166 --> 16:27.000
What are you doing?

237
16:29.266 --> 16:30.500
Kick your car, that's what!

238
16:32.833 --> 16:34.400
Stop! Are you crazy?!

239
16:34.500 --> 16:35.300
No way!

240
16:35.600 --> 16:37.566
I'm kicking it until I feel better!

241
16:38.166 --> 16:39.400
Chat, stop her.

242
16:39.600 --> 16:40.433
That's your car.

243
16:40.633 --> 16:41.433
Why should I stop her?

244
16:41.766 --> 16:43.866
I'm not risking my neck over some crazy girl.

245
16:48.300 --> 16:49.100
Film it.

246
16:50.066 --> 16:50.966
The harder you kicks,

247
16:51.366 --> 16:52.766
the more expensive the damages will be.

248
16:53.366 --> 16:54.500
(Chat) This is satisfying. (Nant) Keep filming!

249
16:54.900 --> 16:55.951
Get a clear shot!

250
16:55.951 --> 16:56.466
Yeah.

251
16:56.633 --> 16:57.233
It's clear.

252
16:57.233 --> 16:58.150
Make sure you get it clearly!

253
16:58.150 --> 16:59.200
Yeah, crystal clear.

254
17:00.700 --> 17:01.433
Go on!

255
17:01.433 --> 17:03.200
Is that all you can do?

256
17:04.366 --> 17:05.400
Fine, fine, fine!

257
17:08.461 --> 17:09.860
I'll call the insurance company.

258
17:13.600 --> 17:14.751
Hello?

259
17:15.560 --> 17:18.700
There's a dog attacking a car.

260
17:18.700 --> 17:20.760
I'll send you the location.

261
17:23.187 --> 17:24.453
Tired already?

262
17:26.707 --> 17:28.707
Go on, do it.

263
17:32.800 --> 17:35.766
The preliminary estimate is 380,000 baht.

264
17:36.300 --> 17:37.100
What?!

265
17:37.500 --> 17:38.300
380,000?!

266
17:39.033 --> 17:39.833
Yes.

267
17:40.000 --> 17:40.800
These are the details.

268
17:44.266 --> 17:46.627
All I did was kick the car, and it's 380,000?

269
17:46.627 --> 17:47.521
Why?

270
17:47.521 --> 17:49.666
Why does the repair cost 380,000 baht?

271
17:52.033 --> 17:52.833
It's an imported car.

272
17:53.566 --> 17:54.566
The parts have to be imported.

273
17:55.233 --> 17:56.666
That's the standard rate.

274
17:58.433 --> 18:00.266
Stop complaining and sign it.

275
18:02.800 --> 18:03.600
Sign here.

276
18:23.200 --> 18:24.000
About the money.

277
18:24.566 --> 18:25.400
I don't have it.

278
18:26.900 --> 18:29.966
But I have something you want even more than money.

279
18:32.100 --> 18:33.266
What nonsense are you talking about now?

280
18:37.000 --> 18:38.309
Well...

281
18:39.623 --> 18:41.233
It's about your former groom.

282
18:43.000 --> 18:43.866
Didn't you know?

283
18:44.966 --> 18:46.500
He's not into women.

284
18:47.200 --> 18:49.600
If that gets out to the press,

285
18:50.300 --> 18:52.300
what will happen to your reputation?

286
18:57.800 --> 18:59.077
And what do you think?

287
18:59.987 --> 19:02.690
If people find out Yong is gay,

288
19:03.347 --> 19:07.001
who do you think gets dragged harder, you or me?

289
19:08.417 --> 19:10.427
A woman who got pregnant by a gay man..

290
19:11.742 --> 19:13.518
That's already an interesting headline.

291
19:14.529 --> 19:15.167
Don't you think?

292
19:19.100 --> 19:20.446
I figured as much.

293
19:20.446 --> 19:23.366
As if someone like you would be bothered by this.

294
19:25.866 --> 19:28.033
But I've got something even better.

295
19:36.700 --> 19:40.256
Ai, Jaokha, you can go back first.

296
19:40.762 --> 19:42.048
I need to settle something with this girl.

297
19:43.514 --> 19:46.033
About you. I'll get back to you later.

298
19:46.566 --> 19:47.366
Yes, ma'am.

299
20:08.066 --> 20:08.866
Ow!

300
20:09.033 --> 20:10.233
What the hell are you doing?

301
20:14.833 --> 20:15.633
All done.

302
20:16.566 --> 20:17.966
Tomorrow's headline:

303
20:18.700 --> 20:19.500
CEO

304
20:20.966 --> 20:23.555
caught having an affair with...

305
20:24.516 --> 20:25.935
her own groom's girl.

306
20:28.866 --> 20:29.666
Oh.

307
20:32.066 --> 20:33.500
You'll be even more famous now.

308
20:38.766 --> 20:39.566
Sigh...

309
20:39.866 --> 20:42.100
You think this lousy deepfake video will work?

310
20:42.866 --> 20:44.700
Now you'll face even more charges

311
20:45.266 --> 20:46.466
for fabricating false information

312
20:47.066 --> 20:48.233
and slandering me.

313
20:50.166 --> 20:51.700
You'll be going to prison for a long time.

314
20:55.600 --> 20:56.816
I figured as much.

315
20:56.816 --> 20:59.400
As if someone like you would be bothered by this.

316
21:03.700 --> 21:05.400
Let's check out the real deal, then.

317
21:12.066 --> 21:12.866
I've had enough!

318
21:14.800 --> 21:15.966
Please, just let me go.

319
21:16.400 --> 21:18.366
Your men beat me half to death

320
21:18.800 --> 21:20.033
or running away from the wedding.

321
21:22.400 --> 21:23.433
What's this video?

322
21:23.900 --> 21:24.700
Oh?

323
21:24.833 --> 21:28.300
Oh, just the video of you getting your ex-groom beaten up.

324
21:28.833 --> 21:29.700
Don't you remember?

325
21:30.966 --> 21:31.766
Ooh.

326
21:32.400 --> 21:33.400
If this gets out...

327
21:33.800 --> 21:37.266
Oh, what if this video gets into the hands of the press?

328
21:39.266 --> 21:41.233
I don't even want to think about it.

329
21:47.716 --> 21:51.182
No, no, no.

330
21:52.633 --> 21:53.833
What exactly do you want?

331
21:55.033 --> 21:56.600
This is so cute.

332
21:57.833 --> 22:00.233
Now we're talking.

333
22:03.666 --> 22:07.300
First, you have to waive the car repair costs.

334
22:12.066 --> 22:14.315
In exchange, you have to delete that video.

335
22:14.315 --> 22:15.468
I'm not done yet.

336
22:16.176 --> 22:19.153
Second, you have to hire me

337
22:20.566 --> 22:24.174
as your personal secretary intern

338
22:24.882 --> 22:28.385
for three months, at double the salary.

339
22:30.033 --> 22:33.066
In your dreams! Why would I let you work by my side?

340
22:34.200 --> 22:35.466
Suit yourself.

341
22:37.666 --> 22:41.566
But your reputation is in my hands now.

342
22:45.700 --> 22:46.700
How about now?

343
22:51.566 --> 22:53.300
Go ahead, scream. Scream all you want.

344
22:57.700 --> 22:59.875
Just remember this.

345
23:00.482 --> 23:03.633
Working at my company will be hell for you.

346
23:05.600 --> 23:07.352
Hell with double the salary?

347
23:08.110 --> 23:10.524
Totally worth it.

348
23:16.033 --> 23:17.033
Seven sharp.

349
23:17.700 --> 23:19.700
Don't be late, not even by a second.

350
23:21.300 --> 23:22.100
You got it.

351
23:24.100 --> 23:26.600
My name is Thitinant.

352
23:27.500 --> 23:29.266
You can just call me Nant.

353
23:31.266 --> 23:32.266
See you tomorrow.

354
23:33.879 --> 23:35.879
See you, baby.

355
23:47.966 --> 23:49.800
I can't believe someone could be this shameless.

356
23:53.800 --> 23:54.833
Get a hold of yourself.

357
23:55.033 --> 23:55.833
Theerachat.

358
24:31.366 --> 24:32.300
Good morning.

359
24:33.366 --> 24:34.166
Yeah.

360
24:34.166 --> 24:36.109
Boss Chat says you have to wait here.

361
24:36.109 --> 24:37.296
Don't get up.

362
24:37.296 --> 24:38.357
Don't make any noise.

363
24:38.357 --> 24:41.100
And absolutely do not go near her office unless you're called in.

364
24:41.566 --> 24:42.366
Yes.

365
25:19.166 --> 25:19.966
Hey, you.

366
25:20.366 --> 25:21.600
You're Thitinant, right?

367
25:22.666 --> 25:23.466
Hey, you!

368
25:24.200 --> 25:25.000
Hey!

369
25:25.233 --> 25:26.233
You're Thitinant, right?

370
25:43.966 --> 25:45.992
Good morning, I'm Nant.

371
25:46.801 --> 25:49.100
Boss Chat told me to come here as an intern.

372
25:49.600 --> 25:50.100
Yes.

373
25:50.707 --> 25:51.486
I know.

374
25:52.750 --> 25:54.267
I've been seeing your face all night.

375
25:57.500 --> 25:58.485
Yes.

376
25:59.092 --> 26:00.197
My name is Hanna.

377
26:00.450 --> 26:01.506
I'm Boss Chat's secretary.

378
26:02.618 --> 26:05.086
You can call me Hanna.

379
26:05.700 --> 26:06.500
Okay.

380
26:07.166 --> 26:07.966
Sure.

381
26:08.433 --> 26:09.466
Hannah.

382
26:10.800 --> 26:12.066
Wait here for now.

383
26:14.233 --> 26:15.066
Don't get up.

384
26:15.966 --> 26:16.800
Don't make any noise.

385
26:18.500 --> 26:20.300
Don't go anywhere near her office.

386
26:21.233 --> 26:22.366
Not unless you're told to.

387
26:23.966 --> 26:24.766
Yes.

388
26:25.166 --> 26:26.900
Boss Chat asked me to pass that along.

389
26:27.866 --> 26:28.566
Yes.

390
26:28.566 --> 26:29.366
Understood.

391
26:30.233 --> 26:31.033
Yes.

392
26:58.433 --> 26:59.400
Nant?

393
27:00.400 --> 27:01.200
Nant.

394
27:03.600 --> 27:04.400
Nant?

395
27:19.500 --> 27:20.300
Good morning.

396
27:29.366 --> 27:31.100
Has Boss Chat called me in yet?

397
27:32.433 --> 27:34.100
The boss is busy right now.

398
27:35.833 --> 27:37.700
She has to sort out the mess from yesterday's wedding.

399
27:38.633 --> 27:41.600
Who knew someone could cause such a huge mess?

400
27:43.600 --> 27:44.700
Keep waiting, okay?

401
27:48.466 --> 27:49.266
Yes.

402
27:53.166 --> 27:54.900
Waiting here is no problem at all.

403
28:23.566 --> 28:24.586
Boss Chat?

404
28:25.041 --> 28:27.262
That girl has been waiting for five hours.

405
28:27.262 --> 28:28.633
Should I ask her to come in?

406
28:30.266 --> 28:31.766
Feeling sorry for her, Secretary Han?

407
28:34.433 --> 28:35.233
No, boss.

408
28:36.800 --> 28:38.200
Just let her keep waiting.

409
28:38.633 --> 28:39.700
If she can handle it, let her.

410
28:39.966 --> 28:42.566
If not, she'll give up and leave on her own.

411
28:43.700 --> 28:44.500
Yes, boss.

412
28:44.833 --> 28:45.666
And one more thing.

413
28:46.400 --> 28:48.233
I don't want anything to do with that girl.

414
28:49.200 --> 28:50.833
Go get Mr. Wichai for me.

415
28:51.766 --> 28:52.800
Understood, boss.

416
28:57.366 --> 28:57.866
Um...

417
28:59.079 --> 29:00.731
Has Boss Chat called me in yet?

418
29:03.566 --> 29:04.778
Boss Chat is busy.

419
29:05.536 --> 29:06.279
So...

420
29:07.290 --> 29:08.093
Sit.

421
29:08.093 --> 29:08.593
And wait.

422
29:09.503 --> 29:10.705
For now, okay?

423
29:17.166 --> 29:18.033
Understood.

424
29:38.033 --> 29:38.833
Close the door!

425
29:41.700 --> 29:42.500
Close it!

426
30:06.366 --> 30:07.266
It's already three in the afternoon.

427
30:10.500 --> 30:11.300
I'm starving.

428
30:27.000 --> 30:27.800
Here.

429
30:29.233 --> 30:30.033
Eat up.

430
30:35.966 --> 30:36.766
Thank you.

431
30:39.900 --> 30:41.766
And don't leave the wrapper lying around when you're done.

432
30:42.833 --> 30:43.633
Thank you.

433
30:44.400 --> 30:47.166
I'd be in real trouble

434
30:47.900 --> 30:49.100
without you, Hanna

435
30:51.366 --> 30:54.100
Eat, then sit quietly. Don't go anywhere.

436
31:31.966 --> 31:35.700
Wait a second, Nant. You're interning at Mrs. Chat's company?

437
31:37.366 --> 31:38.166
Yeah.

438
31:39.966 --> 31:41.433
You've lost your mind, Nant.

439
31:41.966 --> 31:43.066
You're practically asking to die.

440
31:44.966 --> 31:46.366
Haven't you heard?

441
31:47.633 --> 31:49.166
The most dangerous place

442
31:49.666 --> 31:51.100
is the safest place.

443
31:51.633 --> 31:52.433
Sure, whatever you say.

444
31:53.033 --> 31:55.800
You'll be lucky to make it out of there in one piece today.

445
31:59.600 --> 32:00.566
Just talking about her makes my blood boil.

446
32:01.033 --> 32:02.000
She's so cruel!

447
32:02.400 --> 32:05.066
She left me waiting outside her office all day.

448
32:06.366 --> 32:07.166
I needed to pee.

449
32:07.400 --> 32:08.200
I was starving, too.

450
32:08.800 --> 32:10.300
I was too scared to get up and go anywhere.

451
32:10.666 --> 32:11.766
I was afraid she'd call for me while I was gone.

452
32:16.200 --> 32:17.600
By the way, what about your parents?

453
32:17.800 --> 32:19.021
Didn't they scold you at all?

454
32:19.021 --> 32:19.633
Hmm.

455
32:20.666 --> 32:21.466
No, they didn't.

456
32:22.200 --> 32:23.000
Really?

457
32:26.166 --> 32:29.166
So she didn't tell your family about my fake pregnancy prank?

458
32:29.666 --> 32:31.227
I guess she didn't want to make a scene.

459
32:32.036 --> 32:34.600
So she just let my Pa take all the blame at the press conference.

460
32:35.433 --> 32:37.633
After causing such a huge mess,

461
32:38.400 --> 32:40.633
Won't your parents cut you out of the will?

462
32:40.833 --> 32:41.769
I got chewed out pretty badly.

463
32:41.769 --> 32:43.366
But don't forget,

464
32:43.366 --> 32:45.915
I'm the only son in the family.

465
32:46.724 --> 32:49.466
They just put on a show of being mad. They'll go easy on me in the end.

466
32:49.833 --> 32:50.333
Yeah.

467
32:50.990 --> 32:53.000
At least your family didn't recognize Nant.

468
32:53.866 --> 32:54.366
Right.

469
32:54.770 --> 32:56.404
But I'm still stressed out.

470
32:56.900 --> 32:57.559
Well...

471
32:58.216 --> 32:59.966
My mom's trying to find me another wife again.

472
33:00.300 --> 33:00.994
Oh, come on.

473
33:01.752 --> 33:04.600
Just tell her you're not into women.

474
33:05.200 --> 33:06.000
I don't have the guts.

475
33:06.633 --> 33:10.900
Oh, then just put up with it and stop complaining, Your Highness.

476
33:11.633 --> 33:12.433
And...

477
33:13.200 --> 33:14.000
Nant.

478
33:14.800 --> 33:16.366
Besides watching out for Mrs. Chat,

479
33:16.600 --> 33:18.666
don't forget your ex, Mind.

480
33:18.800 --> 33:20.300
She works at this company, too.

481
33:22.433 --> 33:23.233
I know.

482
33:24.366 --> 33:26.600
But she's in the design department.

483
33:26.833 --> 33:27.866
I probably won't run into her.

484
33:28.300 --> 33:29.100
Oh.

485
33:29.466 --> 33:30.566
Yeah, right!

486
33:31.100 --> 33:32.233
You broke up ages ago.

487
33:32.600 --> 33:34.500
When are you going to stop checking her stories?

488
33:35.166 --> 33:36.066
She cheated on you

489
33:37.000 --> 33:37.900
and abused you.

490
33:40.000 --> 33:41.233
It took everything to get you away from her.

491
33:41.433 --> 33:43.100
We almost had to take you to get a curse lifted.

492
33:44.366 --> 33:45.600
Stop talking about her already.

493
33:46.700 --> 33:48.066
I'm not falling for her again.

494
33:58.200 --> 33:59.135
Hello?

495
34:00.551 --> 34:01.296
Yes.

496
34:01.903 --> 34:02.932
I'm on my way.

497
34:03.791 --> 34:05.308
I'll be there in an hour.

498
34:05.864 --> 34:07.620
Okay, see you then.

499
34:12.033 --> 34:12.900
I'm heading out.

500
34:14.100 --> 34:17.033
I've got a fake-girlfriend gig today.

501
34:23.033 --> 34:23.833
See you.

502
34:25.033 --> 34:25.533
Yeah.

503
34:25.533 --> 34:26.100
See you.

504
34:26.500 --> 34:28.939
Get paid and come straight home. Don't go drinking afterward.

505
34:28.939 --> 34:31.033
You have to go to war with Mrs. Chat first thing tomorrow.

506
34:31.866 --> 34:34.033
Sure thing. Bye!

507
34:34.766 --> 34:35.566
Bye.

508
34:47.233 --> 34:48.912
Oh! Good morning, Boss Chat!

509
34:49.569 --> 34:51.823
I've been here since six-thirty.

510
35:33.766 --> 35:34.700
Boss Chat?

511
35:37.000 --> 35:38.466
What is that girl up to?

512
35:40.500 --> 35:42.166
I'm not quite sure either.

513
35:42.600 --> 35:43.900
Would you like me to go check?

514
35:45.374 --> 35:46.515
Yeah.

515
35:48.433 --> 35:50.433
I'll go take a look.

516
35:59.066 --> 35:59.866
Wow.

517
36:01.700 --> 36:02.866
She's folding those so fast.

518
36:03.500 --> 36:04.300
What are you doing?

519
36:05.800 --> 36:06.666
This is an office,

520
36:06.966 --> 36:07.833
not a temple fair.

521
36:09.100 --> 36:09.900
Oh.

522
36:10.766 --> 36:11.566
Um...

523
36:11.900 --> 36:13.200
I knew the boss

524
36:13.400 --> 36:15.266
wouldn't have time to call me in,

525
36:16.466 --> 36:19.233
so I took an order to fold money cones for a ceremony.

526
36:19.900 --> 36:20.700
Hmph.

527
36:21.700 --> 36:24.566
My time is money, after all.

528
36:30.233 --> 36:31.400
May I take a look?

529
36:35.833 --> 36:37.327
You'd better put those away.

530
36:37.327 --> 36:39.500
The boss will scold you if she sees them.

531
36:42.833 --> 36:44.500
Then she can come out and scold me herself.

532
36:45.600 --> 36:47.566
Instead of hiding behind the blinds.

533
36:50.900 --> 36:51.700
Hello?

534
36:52.366 --> 36:53.166
Yeah, yeah.

535
37:00.200 --> 37:01.366
You'd better put those away.

536
37:09.266 --> 37:09.918
Boss?

537
37:09.918 --> 37:10.666
Hmm?

538
37:10.900 --> 37:12.200
Money cones for a ceremony.

539
37:14.366 --> 37:15.166
Unbelievable.

540
37:15.900 --> 37:16.800
Absolutely amazing.

541
37:17.600 --> 37:18.766
I can't believe someone like her exists.

542
37:25.966 --> 37:26.866
Secretary Han.

543
37:27.400 --> 37:28.565
Yes, boss?

544
37:28.565 --> 37:30.359
Take these reports from the past three years

545
37:30.713 --> 37:32.033
and have that girl sort them out.

546
37:32.700 --> 37:33.607
All of these?

547
37:33.910 --> 37:37.066
It would take me a whole week to organize them, boss.

548
37:37.500 --> 37:38.776
Get them done today.

549
37:39.534 --> 37:41.500
If she can't do that, don't bother coming in tomorrow.

550
37:42.300 --> 37:43.233
Understood, boss.

551
37:54.833 --> 37:56.433
So your time is money, huh?

552
37:57.366 --> 37:59.633
I'll teach you what the real world is like.

553
38:00.266 --> 38:01.233
You little troublemaker.

554
38:13.000 --> 38:13.669
Sign it.

555
38:14.377 --> 38:15.566
I don't have all day.

556
38:18.833 --> 38:19.633
Um...

557
38:21.033 --> 38:21.833
The language...

558
38:24.033 --> 38:26.500
The company is expanding into China,

559
38:27.166 --> 38:29.200
so the assistant's contract is in Chinese, too.

560
38:30.666 --> 38:31.466
What?

561
38:32.100 --> 38:33.000
Can't read it?

562
38:42.666 --> 38:44.566
[Clause 1: Employee]

563
38:45.700 --> 38:47.666
Must follow all orders from the employer.

564
38:49.866 --> 38:50.792
[Clause 5]

565
38:50.792 --> 38:51.856
Clause five.

566
38:52.159 --> 38:53.588
Double salary, as agreed.

567
38:53.588 --> 38:57.136
Am I your personal assistant or your general servant?

568
38:57.829 --> 39:00.100
Since when do waiters speak such fluent Chinese?

569
39:00.633 --> 39:03.866
Well, Chinese guests give big tips, boss.

570
39:05.500 --> 39:06.300
Oh.

571
39:06.666 --> 39:07.766
I almost forgot.

572
39:08.866 --> 39:09.666
Here you go.

573
39:10.033 --> 39:12.600
I've been folding these for you all day, boss.

574
39:12.833 --> 39:13.633
These ones.

575
39:13.666 --> 39:15.800
You can use them at your next wedding, boss.

576
39:16.200 --> 39:18.300
Maybe it'll keep it from falling apart this time.

577
39:19.300 --> 39:20.766
Save them for your own funeral.

578
39:21.100 --> 39:22.800
Oh, I can't do that, boss.

579
39:23.366 --> 39:25.100
This color is considered lucky.

580
39:26.000 --> 39:26.917
If...

581
39:26.917 --> 39:27.417
Um...

582
39:28.100 --> 39:31.033
I think I'd better take Nant to get started on her work.

583
39:31.433 --> 39:32.233
Start now.

584
39:33.833 --> 39:35.866
Then let's get going. Come on.

585
39:37.233 --> 39:38.033
Get up.

586
39:39.366 --> 39:40.833
Aren't you taking the contract?

587
39:44.666 --> 39:46.433
I'll take care of it, boss.

588
39:56.566 --> 39:58.300
Save them for your own funeral.

589
39:59.033 --> 39:59.833
Thitinant!

590
40:08.666 --> 40:09.466
Annoying.

591
40:18.566 --> 40:19.566
Nant...

592
40:23.900 --> 40:26.066
I've worked with the boss for years,

593
40:26.466 --> 40:29.666
I've never seen anyone annoy the boss every five minutes like you do.

594
40:31.233 --> 40:33.300
But the boss always picks on me first.

595
40:35.066 --> 40:36.633
You have to be calm.

596
40:37.500 --> 40:38.866
Don't cause trouble for the boss.

597
40:39.433 --> 40:41.300
I don't want to be cleaning up a body at work.

598
40:45.233 --> 40:46.033
Okay.

599
40:47.100 --> 40:47.900
Let's go.

600
40:48.300 --> 40:49.200
It's your first day.

601
40:49.766 --> 40:51.800
Don't give me any more headaches, okay?

602
40:55.633 --> 40:57.066
Understood, Hanna.

603
41:08.033 --> 41:08.833
It the numbers

604
41:08.833 --> 41:10.066
don't align with our last

605
41:10.200 --> 41:10.666
quarter

606
41:10.666 --> 41:11.466
projection

607
41:11.466 --> 41:12.666
I'm afraid we cannot

608
41:14.600 --> 41:16.666
[If we can't resolve this issue,]

609
41:16.666 --> 41:18.233
[there's no point in continuing this discussion.]

610
41:26.233 --> 41:28.500
Have you finished entering the sales figures?

611
41:31.633 --> 41:34.100
Did Mom ask you to get the documents for tomorrow's meeting?

612
41:34.466 --> 41:37.400
Yes. Um, Chat, I have a question.

613
41:38.066 --> 41:39.509
Is it work-related?

614
41:40.116 --> 41:42.950
If not, wait until I'm done working.

615
41:44.770 --> 41:45.566
Go ahead.

616
41:47.700 --> 41:48.500
Sure.

617
41:51.766 --> 41:54.600
This is the quarterly comparison dashboard.

618
41:55.100 --> 41:58.966
The highlighted points here show unusual costs.

619
41:59.700 --> 42:02.966
And over here, I've translated the comments from our Chinese clients.

620
42:18.300 --> 42:20.750
It's decent enough

621
42:21.104 --> 42:22.033
for an intern.

622
42:24.100 --> 42:26.866
Wait, you did all this yourself?

623
42:28.500 --> 42:29.300
Yes.

624
42:30.066 --> 42:32.400
Wow, this is really good, Chat!

625
42:32.600 --> 42:34.433
Why'd you say it's just decent?

626
42:35.266 --> 42:37.866
Oh, if you're done, you can leave now, Chom.

627
42:38.068 --> 42:38.568
Go on.

628
42:38.568 --> 42:39.266
What?

629
42:39.700 --> 42:40.500
Okay.

630
42:40.800 --> 42:41.600
Fine, I'll go.

631
42:48.800 --> 42:49.600
Close the door.

632
42:50.000 --> 42:50.800
Okay.

633
42:54.800 --> 42:57.266
Your sister is pretty cute.

634
42:59.266 --> 43:00.600
But the boss is even cuter.

635
43:06.466 --> 43:07.633
Why are you smiling, Boss?

636
43:10.900 --> 43:12.233
Get back to work.

637
43:12.766 --> 43:13.566
Go!

638
43:14.000 --> 43:14.800
Yes, boss.

639
43:15.633 --> 43:18.033
But can I have my iPad back, please?

640
44:05.866 --> 44:06.866
Thitinant.

641
44:18.900 --> 44:20.400
Thitinant Inganan!

642
44:23.666 --> 44:25.666
Stop making all that annoying noise!

643
44:26.666 --> 44:27.467
And another thing,

644
44:28.428 --> 44:30.600
could you dress more appropriately for the workplace?

645
44:31.566 --> 44:33.166
This is an office, not your home.

646
44:33.700 --> 44:36.200
But this is my university uniform, Boss.

647
44:36.900 --> 44:39.033
It's just a little disheveled.

648
44:40.500 --> 44:41.300
But...

649
44:41.966 --> 44:43.566
It's perfectly clean, Boss.

650
44:46.400 --> 44:47.300
And it smells really nice, too.

651
44:47.966 --> 44:49.433
Want to smell it, Boss?

652
44:51.366 --> 44:52.700
Cleanliness and appropriateness

653
44:53.400 --> 44:54.400
are two different things.

654
44:55.466 --> 44:57.700
Dress more professionally tomorrow.

655
44:57.866 --> 44:59.166
Okay, okay.

656
44:59.566 --> 45:03.400
I'll dress extra nicely tomorrow, Boss.

657
45:05.633 --> 45:06.238
Good.

658
45:07.451 --> 45:09.481
Use the money you earn from your dirty work

659
45:10.088 --> 45:12.558
to buy yourself some expensive clothes.

660
45:17.033 --> 45:19.233
So you judge people by what they wear, Boss?

661
45:20.600 --> 45:21.966
Be careful. You might get fooled.

662
45:23.000 --> 45:24.700
Plenty of people who dress expensively

663
45:25.900 --> 45:27.700
behave terribly.

664
45:29.566 --> 45:30.666
Are you talking about me?

665
45:31.366 --> 45:33.666
Is your thousand-baht bill as big as a house, Boss?

666
45:35.000 --> 45:36.166
I'm just telling the truth.

667
45:37.100 --> 45:38.500
Do you think being rich

668
45:38.966 --> 45:40.066
puts you above everyone else

669
45:40.466 --> 45:42.300
and gives you the right to judge them?

670
45:44.000 --> 45:45.800
I've never thought I'm above anyone.

671
45:46.800 --> 45:49.166
But I've never lowered my standards,either.

672
45:50.800 --> 45:52.124
Then how about a bet?

673
45:53.186 --> 45:54.000
One day,

674
45:54.708 --> 45:56.368
those high standards of yours

675
45:57.126 --> 45:59.200
will come down for this girl.

676
46:00.700 --> 46:02.433
You'll end up begging to get into bed with me.

677
46:03.433 --> 46:04.233
You're so full of yourself.

678
46:05.166 --> 46:06.466
You think someone like you

679
46:06.900 --> 46:08.766
could make me beg to sleep with you?

680
46:09.400 --> 46:11.766
Here's the deal. If you fall for me,

681
46:12.566 --> 46:14.466
you'll have to become my servant instead.

682
46:15.033 --> 46:15.833
Do you dare?

683
46:20.366 --> 46:21.384
You're awfully confident, aren't you?

684
46:22.294 --> 46:22.794
Remember this.

685
46:23.502 --> 46:26.321
I'd never stoop so low as to waste my time on a girl like you.

686
46:29.300 --> 46:30.627
Get ready to eat your words.

687
46:31.840 --> 46:33.362
Because this girl right here

688
46:33.766 --> 46:35.130
will make you fall for her

689
46:35.433 --> 46:37.060
so hard you won't be able to escape. Just you wait.

690
46:55.266 --> 46:57.766
In your dreams. Never gonna happen.

691
47:16.866 --> 47:18.766
Here's the coffee you like, Boss.

692
47:20.700 --> 47:23.200
I made it especially for you.

693
47:24.166 --> 47:25.500
Go on, give it a try.

694
47:55.366 --> 47:56.691
Thitinant.

695
47:57.652 --> 47:59.835
If you've got pink eye, go see a doctor.

696
48:00.694 --> 48:01.966
Don't go spreading it around here.

697
48:02.366 --> 48:03.735
Oh, come on, Boss!

698
48:04.190 --> 48:05.782
I was giving you a flirty look.

699
48:09.300 --> 48:10.007
Ugh!

700
48:11.574 --> 48:14.800
And what's wrong with your lips? Why are they so pale?

701
48:18.700 --> 48:20.461
Well, it's the 'plain and wholesome' look, Boss.

702
48:20.461 --> 48:21.066
Ugh!

703
48:21.233 --> 48:23.400
went out of my way to do my makeup just for you, Boss!

704
48:23.766 --> 48:25.000
And you don't even get it.

705
48:26.366 --> 48:28.566
If this is how you make up to impress me,

706
48:29.600 --> 48:31.400
go back and try harder.

707
48:33.266 --> 48:36.400
And don't come slacking off around here talking nonsense again.

708
48:37.233 --> 48:38.033
Get up.

709
48:44.700 --> 48:45.500
Understood.

710
48:49.066 --> 48:50.900
Don't forget to drink your coffee, Boss.

711
48:51.566 --> 48:52.866
Maybe something sweet

712
48:53.566 --> 48:55.100
will put you in a better mood.

713
48:56.900 --> 48:58.833
Or did I not add enough sugar?

714
49:02.033 --> 49:04.000
But I guess sugar isn't the problem, huh?

715
49:04.633 --> 49:06.300
It's probably your personality, Boss.

716
49:06.900 --> 49:07.700
Get out!

717
49:20.866 --> 49:22.233
Hello, Secretary Han.

718
49:22.700 --> 49:23.833
Order me a coffee, please.

719
49:25.100 --> 49:27.200
Make it extra bitter and strong.

720
49:33.557 --> 49:35.557
You little brat.

721
49:48.272 --> 49:50.509
(You barely eat or sleep, and spend all your time working.)

722
49:50.509 --> 49:51.592
(No wonder you're so grumpy.)

723
49:51.592 --> 49:53.150
(When am I supposed to find time to be with you?)

724
49:58.624 --> 50:00.624
(Overworking makes you look old, Boss!) (Give your brain a break.)

725
50:01.170 --> 50:02.513
(Wow, you read that fast. Were you waiting for my messages?)

726
50:02.513 --> 50:04.085
(You read but didn't reply?)

727
50:04.085 --> 50:06.011
(Let's see how long you can stand being annoyed.)

728
50:12.460 --> 50:13.909
(If you have time to send me this garbage,

729
50:13.909 --> 50:15.444
then make 50 copies of the meeting minutes.)

730
50:15.444 --> 50:16.546
(And file them all before 4 PM.)

731
50:16.673 --> 50:18.828
(Boss, I saw how stressed you were,

732
50:18.828 --> 50:20.688
so I sent you some cuteness to cheer you up.)

733
50:22.691 --> 50:23.869
(If I get another one of these pointless messages,

734
50:23.869 --> 50:24.938
I'll deduct 500 baht from your salary for each one.)

735
50:24.938 --> 50:26.385
(Starting with that last photo.)

736
50:26.385 --> 50:28.165
(Does this even count as a nonsense text?) (Better not risk it. I don't want to get fined.)

737
50:35.200 --> 50:36.000
Ugh!

738
50:37.166 --> 50:39.166
Fifty sets of documents?

739
50:41.100 --> 50:42.866
You're really getting your money's worth out of me.

740
50:44.500 --> 50:47.400
I should've asked for triple the salary!

741
50:51.766 --> 50:52.600
Let's go home.

742
51:08.266 --> 51:09.066
Hey!

743
51:09.900 --> 51:10.700
Ouch!

744
51:12.433 --> 51:14.566
What's wrong with you now, old man?

745
51:27.300 --> 51:28.100
Ouch!

746
51:29.566 --> 51:31.233
Ow! I think my leg's broken!

747
51:31.966 --> 51:32.766
Ouch!

748
51:32.966 --> 51:33.800
I been hit by a car!

749
51:34.866 --> 51:35.577
I been hit by a car!

750
51:35.577 --> 51:36.269
Help!

751
51:36.269 --> 51:36.900
I been hit by a car!

752
51:37.600 --> 51:38.400
I been hit by a car!

753
51:39.866 --> 51:40.866
Oh, come on!

754
51:41.566 --> 51:42.633
I didn't even hit you.

755
51:43.266 --> 51:44.066
Wait a minute.

756
51:44.600 --> 51:45.400
I didn't hit you!

757
51:46.033 --> 51:47.200
I stopped in time.

758
51:47.466 --> 51:48.266
There was plenty of space between us.

759
51:49.400 --> 51:50.200
Oh.

760
51:50.366 --> 51:51.800
You were coming at me so fast.

761
51:52.066 --> 51:53.500
How was I supposed to dodge in time?

762
51:57.200 --> 51:58.966
Let me take a look.

763
52:00.066 --> 52:01.600
Easy, Boss!

764
52:02.100 --> 52:02.900
It hurts!

765
52:03.466 --> 52:04.266
Does it hurt here?

766
52:06.366 --> 52:07.166
Ow. It hurts.

767
52:07.666 --> 52:08.466
It hurts.

768
52:10.566 --> 52:11.500
Calm down.

769
52:12.266 --> 52:13.666
Okay, how about this? Um...

770
52:13.966 --> 52:15.700
I'll call an ambulance.

771
52:16.266 --> 52:17.633
About the expenses,

772
52:18.000 --> 52:19.634
I'll cover everything myself.

773
52:20.900 --> 52:22.066
I'm fine, Boss.

774
52:23.300 --> 52:24.466
There's no need to go that far.

775
52:31.033 --> 52:31.766
It hurts.

776
52:31.766 --> 52:32.566
Why?

777
52:33.766 --> 52:37.066
Or are you faking it?

778
52:38.800 --> 52:39.600
Oh, come on!

779
52:40.066 --> 52:42.000
Who would be crazy enough to fake an injury?

780
52:45.033 --> 52:47.366
Then if you're fine, get up.

781
52:47.833 --> 52:50.266
Are you going to lie there until another car runs you over?

782
52:50.900 --> 52:51.700
I'm leaving.

783
52:53.266 --> 52:54.833
Wait, Boss.

784
52:55.800 --> 52:58.100
Aren't you going to take any responsibility for me?

785
52:59.500 --> 53:00.725
Responsibility for what?

786
53:00.927 --> 53:02.231
You're the one who jumped in front of my car!

787
53:02.231 --> 53:04.602
There was plenty of distance between us.

788
53:06.833 --> 53:07.818
Ouch!

789
53:17.523 --> 53:18.613
Calm down.

790
53:18.992 --> 53:20.133
Don't move yet.

791
53:21.460 --> 53:22.651
Just take it easy.

792
53:25.821 --> 53:27.409
Boss...

793
53:36.233 --> 53:37.800
If I can't walk anymore,

794
53:39.633 --> 53:42.166
you'll have to take care of me for the rest of my life.

795
53:44.700 --> 53:45.766
I'll take responsibility,

796
53:46.433 --> 53:47.766
but not for the rest of your life.

797
53:49.366 --> 53:50.666
Can you walk?

798
53:51.900 --> 53:53.900
Come on. I'll help you.

799
53:56.000 --> 53:56.800
Boss...

800
53:57.566 --> 53:58.866
Am I going to die?

801
54:00.975 --> 54:02.077
You're not going to die.

802
54:02.077 --> 54:05.000
But you might need your leg amputated.

803
54:06.411 --> 54:07.956
No.

804
54:08.766 --> 54:09.566
Ouch!

805
54:09.700 --> 54:12.000
Stop making a scene and get in the car. Let's go.

806
54:12.400 --> 54:13.600
I'll take you home.

807
54:23.000 --> 54:23.648
Ooh!

808
54:23.648 --> 54:24.148
Hey!

809
54:24.666 --> 54:25.766
It hurt my leg.

810
54:26.900 --> 54:28.490
I pushed your head,

811
54:28.490 --> 54:29.821
not your leg.

812
54:29.821 --> 54:30.766
Just a reminder.

813
54:38.321 --> 54:39.636
Oh!

814
54:39.636 --> 54:42.603
You were nice for five seconds, then turned mean again.

815
54:47.833 --> 54:48.633
Boss...

816
54:48.766 --> 54:49.566
Hmm?

817
54:49.900 --> 54:51.266
Give me a hug, Boss.

818
54:53.966 --> 54:56.566
Your leg hurts, and now your arms don't work either?

819
55:10.633 --> 55:13.887
If you're in this much pain,

820
55:13.887 --> 55:15.766
why don't you want to go to the hospital?

821
55:17.200 --> 55:18.400
I can handle it.

822
55:21.500 --> 55:23.266
Just take me to my bed.

823
55:25.266 --> 55:27.000
I mean, my room is enough.

824
55:31.166 --> 55:31.966
Whatever you say.

825
55:36.833 --> 55:38.033
Go on, walk slowly then.

826
56:24.066 --> 56:25.366
How romantic.

827
56:53.256 --> 56:54.698
Are you live here?

828
56:55.104 --> 56:56.415
This place...

829
56:56.809 --> 56:58.317
Look kind of shady.

830
56:58.564 --> 57:00.000
I miss you, Nant.

831
57:00.310 --> 57:02.310
You blocked me on everything.

832
57:02.597 --> 57:04.597
If you run into someone who's super stressed

833
57:05.179 --> 57:06.392
or unusually down,

834
57:06.392 --> 57:07.802
What can you do to make them feel better?

835
57:08.122 --> 57:10.811
Ice cream is supposed to lower stress..

836
57:11.327 --> 57:14.262
but if I got to eat you whole, Boss,

837
57:15.663 --> 57:18.253
my stress would completely disappear!

838
57:26.146 --> 57:27.236
Hey!

839
57:29.644 --> 57:30.744
What the hell are you doing?

840
57:31.574 --> 57:32.343
Get out!

841
57:32.343 --> 57:32.891
No

842
57:32.891 --> 57:33.566
Get out!

843
57:42.315 --> 57:43.115
Stop!

844
57:45.696 --> 57:46.496
Get out!
